WEBVTT

00:01.570 --> 00:05.230
Starting today, we'll begin 
preparing for tokudo in earnest.

00:05.690 --> 00:07.490
Are you ready?

00:07.490 --> 00:08.230
Yes!

00:08.740 --> 00:11.420
Let's show that rotten priest a thing or two.

00:11.420 --> 00:12.420
Yes!

00:12.420 --> 00:13.980
Now let me ask you this.

00:14.920 --> 00:17.120
What color is your underwear?

00:21.140 --> 00:24.000
White? Or another color?

00:24.340 --> 00:27.140
Kiki-san, we're short on time. 
Can you take this seriously?

00:27.140 --> 00:28.340
Oh, I'm super serious.

00:29.190 --> 00:34.050
Training is meant to return your body 
and mind to a blank white state.

00:35.290 --> 00:38.630
Even a simple undergarment 
must follow certain rules.

00:38.630 --> 00:41.680
It must be a plain and unadorned white.

00:41.940 --> 00:45.250
I don't own white underwear 
since I wear boxers.

00:45.630 --> 00:47.240
Mine are in the wash.

00:47.240 --> 00:49.190
I only have red and black underwear.

00:49.860 --> 00:51.910
Red and black?

00:51.910 --> 00:54.700
What? Why are you so shocked?

00:55.220 --> 00:57.410
So you don't have any on hand...

00:58.290 --> 00:59.660
We have no choice, then.

00:59.660 --> 01:03.450
Today, you'll train commando.

02:36.630 --> 02:43.140
<b>Episode 7:
What Color Is Your Underwear?</b>

02:38.130 --> 02:40.510
This makes me so anxious.

02:40.810 --> 02:45.500
Yuzuki-san, does it not bother you,
being made to do something so outrageous?

02:45.930 --> 02:51.610
I-It's a little embarrassing, but I can handle 
it if I imagine it's part of my training.

02:56.340 --> 02:57.820
Kiki-san...

02:57.820 --> 02:59.330
Thank you.

02:57.820 --> 02:59.330
I hate you.

02:59.330 --> 03:01.450
That's an impressive trick.

03:02.930 --> 03:04.950
We'll begin with zazen.

03:04.950 --> 03:08.860
Straighten your posture and calm your mind.

03:09.860 --> 03:12.360
No matter what kind of thoughts 
enter your mind,

03:12.360 --> 03:14.840
you must not be distracted by them.

03:15.450 --> 03:19.340
Fail, and I'll whack your 
shoulder with a kyosaku.

03:16.500 --> 03:19.340
<b>Kyosaku</b>

03:22.830 --> 03:28.350
<i>Thank you. This is exactly the 
kind of training I was hoping for.</i>

03:29.470 --> 03:32.590
<i>Mouth loosely closed, eyes half-open.</i>

03:33.750 --> 03:37.050
<i>Breathe slowly through the nose.</i>

03:46.970 --> 03:48.290
<i>This is zazen.</i>

03:49.940 --> 03:56.380
<i>Unblinded by worldly thoughts, 
simply sensing the air around me.</i>

03:57.380 --> 04:01.100
<i>This must be what it means 
to have a calm mind.</i>

04:13.850 --> 04:16.520
QUIVER







QUIVER

04:24.850 --> 04:28.370
What's wrong, Akagami? Get up.

04:29.230 --> 04:31.120
Next, we'll copy sutras.

04:31.120 --> 04:34.460
Write each and every character carefully.

04:35.660 --> 04:40.630
<i>I made a foolish mistake earlier, 
but this shouldn't be a problem.</i>

04:40.630 --> 04:43.880
Oh? You're good at this, Akagami.

04:44.370 --> 04:47.420
I used to work part-time 
at a calligraphy school.

04:47.420 --> 04:50.850
Good handwriting is worth 
a lot as a head priest.

04:52.180 --> 04:56.820
Why don't you give Yuzuki some tips? 
I'm stepping out for a moment.

05:03.150 --> 05:06.410
Yuzuki-san, the way you're holding the brush is...

05:10.270 --> 05:11.160
lewd!

05:11.160 --> 05:12.410
Lewd?!

05:12.410 --> 05:15.620
Oh, I'm sorry! First, your thumb should be—

05:17.250 --> 05:19.500
Oh, jeez. Here, have a tissue...

05:20.250 --> 05:22.000
<b>Crotch</b>

05:20.500 --> 05:22.000
<b>No Underwear</b>

05:23.030 --> 05:25.880
I-I'll clean that up for you.

05:25.880 --> 05:27.130
Mia-san?!

05:29.130 --> 05:31.810
It's okay, it's okay.

05:31.810 --> 05:34.140
Mia-san, stop! No more!

05:35.640 --> 05:36.430
Ow!

05:37.070 --> 05:39.060
What?! Why only me?!

05:39.590 --> 05:40.410
Ow!

05:44.460 --> 05:45.530
Um...

05:46.440 --> 05:49.110
All we did today was get in your way.

05:49.560 --> 05:51.730
Our deepest apologies.

05:52.940 --> 05:54.540
It's okay.

05:54.540 --> 05:57.130
But you know...

05:57.130 --> 06:00.700
Maybe you two should take your time 
instead of accommodating me.

06:00.700 --> 06:02.800
No, it's fine!

06:04.460 --> 06:06.880
We even bought white underwear!

06:06.880 --> 06:08.050
And bras!

06:09.330 --> 06:10.440
Now we're good to go.

06:10.440 --> 06:11.810
Nice work, Akagami!

06:10.490 --> 06:11.220
Uh, okay.

06:11.710 --> 06:14.260
<i>These two are sort of similar.</i>

06:15.060 --> 06:18.920
Well, let's get plenty of rest 
so we can try again tomorrow.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.310
Got it!

06:21.710 --> 06:23.370
We're back!

06:24.850 --> 06:27.820
Starting today, the three 
of you will sleep here.

06:28.300 --> 06:32.450
During your training, each of you 
will sleep on a single tatami mat.

06:32.930 --> 06:35.230
It can't hurt to start getting used to it now.

06:35.870 --> 06:38.020
I can't sleep like this!

06:38.020 --> 06:39.930
All we get are futons on the floor?!

06:39.930 --> 06:42.960
Don't men and women typically 
sleep separately, Kiki-san?

06:43.280 --> 06:45.400
Huh? Kiki-san?!

06:45.400 --> 06:45.960
There!

06:45.960 --> 06:47.880
This should allow us to sleep!

06:47.880 --> 06:49.020
That's it!

06:49.020 --> 06:50.570
Nice thinking, Akagami!

06:56.820 --> 06:58.600
What do you think you're doing?

06:58.890 --> 07:02.450
What need is there for her 
to rush her tokudo so much?

07:02.970 --> 07:08.110
Three months from now, 
a sect meeting will be held at this temple.

07:08.110 --> 07:11.660
<b>Sect Meeting</b>

07:09.230 --> 07:11.420
It was a decision made by the higher-ups.

07:11.660 --> 07:12.110
<b>Sect Meeting</b>

07:11.950 --> 07:12.740
Wha?!

07:12.110 --> 07:14.120
<b>Sect Meeting</b>

07:14.990 --> 07:19.690
Please, don't let my engagement go to waste.

07:24.170 --> 07:25.380
Sheesh.

07:28.790 --> 07:31.020
We'll have to resort to drastic measures.

07:31.880 --> 07:34.890
Mikazuki Temple

07:38.540 --> 07:41.190
None of us got a wink of sleep...

07:43.900 --> 07:48.370
Today, I'm thinking of putting you through 
a slightly different kind of training.

07:54.050 --> 07:57.810
It's also a reward for all the 
hard work you've put in thus far.

07:57.810 --> 07:59.270
A reward?!

08:03.290 --> 08:09.050
<b>Sauna</b>

08:03.290 --> 08:09.050
<b>~The Day After~</b>

08:03.290 --> 08:09.050
<b>Accepting
Reservations</b>

08:03.790 --> 08:07.430
Why are we at a sauna? 
A mixed-gender one, no less?

08:07.430 --> 08:09.050
You're not enjoying this?

08:09.050 --> 08:12.030
I am, which is the problem...

08:13.690 --> 08:15.920
It's a bit of a drastic measure.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.800
You must face your worldly thoughts

08:17.800 --> 08:20.810
and develop a resistance to the opposite sex.

08:21.300 --> 08:24.980
And to do that, well, you know...

08:25.590 --> 08:26.610
You must experience it.

08:26.610 --> 08:27.560
Experience what?!

08:27.860 --> 08:29.820
Let's do our best, Akagami-kun.

08:29.820 --> 08:34.210
We're sure to fail our tokudo in three months 
if this is enough to make us complain.

08:35.380 --> 08:37.070
You're right, Yuzuki-sa—

08:38.490 --> 08:40.450
I'll be okay.

08:40.450 --> 08:41.950
Me, too!

08:57.580 --> 08:59.890
<i>My mind is full of worldly thoughts!</i>

09:00.390 --> 09:03.370
<i>Will this really help me overcome them?</i>

09:07.350 --> 09:09.850
I-It's a little cramped in here.

09:09.850 --> 09:11.930
S-Sorry.

09:11.930 --> 09:13.610
A-Akagami?

09:18.130 --> 09:20.010
I'm sorry, Mia-san!

09:20.010 --> 09:22.620
I-I'm fine, Akagami.

09:22.980 --> 09:27.120
But... could you turn off the lights?

09:27.120 --> 09:29.100
You're not fine at all!

09:31.580 --> 09:33.330
This isn't right, Mia-san.

09:33.330 --> 09:38.510
You're right. We can't keep 
holding back Yuzuki-san's progress.

09:38.510 --> 09:43.060
L-Let's discuss the results 
of our training so far.

09:43.060 --> 09:44.640
Y-Yeah.

09:45.020 --> 09:48.160
Yesterday, we copied sutras and practiced zazen.

09:48.160 --> 09:52.260
Does us sleeping together 
count as training, too?

09:52.260 --> 09:53.650
Now that you mention it,

09:54.390 --> 09:57.160
I noticed something while 
we were sleeping yesterday.

09:57.160 --> 09:58.160
What was it?

09:58.160 --> 10:01.280
I have an Adam's apple fetish!

10:03.170 --> 10:06.860
The way yours bulges is just divine!

10:06.860 --> 10:08.790
That has nothing to do with enlightenment!

10:11.390 --> 10:13.370
Have I done it again?

10:13.370 --> 10:16.450
H-How was it for you, Akagami?

10:16.450 --> 10:19.550
W-Well, last night...

10:21.450 --> 10:23.600
I was rock-hard all night long!

10:23.600 --> 10:25.560
How very masculine of you!

10:26.550 --> 10:28.190
I can't believe I just said that!

10:28.530 --> 10:30.690
Yuzuki-san is bright red!

10:33.190 --> 10:35.850
<i>Why? The worldly thoughts keep coming!</i>

10:35.850 --> 10:41.880
<i>At this rate, I'll earn Yuzuki-san's disgust 
and lose the right to undergo tokudo!</i>

10:41.880 --> 10:42.820
I see.

10:44.030 --> 10:45.140
What?!

10:45.140 --> 10:48.210
I see what Kiki-san is up to.

10:48.810 --> 10:53.710
She wanted us to experience... makyo!

10:54.040 --> 10:55.670
Makyo?!

10:54.460 --> 10:56.170
<b>Makyo</b>

10:57.590 --> 11:00.060
Has the heat finally gotten 
to Yuzuki-san's head?

11:00.060 --> 11:02.970
Is it because I annoyed her?

11:02.970 --> 11:06.470
There's nothing wrong with me! 
"Makyo" is a Buddhist term!

11:06.820 --> 11:08.770
Holy am I, alone throughout heaven and earth.

11:08.770 --> 11:10.780
Actually, I'm hungry. 
I want attention from women.

11:10.670 --> 11:13.760
Makyo is the excited state that occurs

11:10.780 --> 11:12.660
I want to sleep. I want to slack off...

11:13.760 --> 11:17.540
when your latent worldly thoughts and desires

11:17.540 --> 11:20.300
come to the surface during intense training.

11:25.330 --> 11:29.750
If you can overcome it, you'll cease to 
be controlled by your worldly thoughts.

11:26.290 --> 11:27.450
Enlightenment.

11:29.750 --> 11:34.750
What?! So that's what Kiki-san 
wanted us to experience!

11:34.750 --> 11:36.370
Yeah, probably.

11:36.850 --> 11:39.370
Then, Yuzuki-san, it's your turn next.

11:39.370 --> 11:40.010
Huh?

11:40.010 --> 11:44.390
Well, go on! Reveal to us all your erotic words!

11:44.390 --> 11:47.010
Don't act like we're here to share dirty jokes!

11:47.010 --> 11:49.270
Come on, come on!

11:50.090 --> 11:53.770
U-Uh, I...

11:53.770 --> 11:56.330
Come on, come on!

11:56.740 --> 11:57.820
<i>I can't tell them.</i>

11:58.540 --> 12:01.200
<i>I can't tell them I've been thinking 
about Akagami-kun naked—</i>

12:01.200 --> 12:03.200
<i>or rather, a specific part of his body.</i>

12:03.670 --> 12:09.040
<i>I can't tell them the things I saw at the 
love hotel keep replaying in my head.</i>

12:09.530 --> 12:14.660
<i>And I certainly can't tell them I've thought 
about what might've happened next.</i>

12:17.790 --> 12:19.060
Well...

12:20.740 --> 12:24.800
I don't think I have any worldly thoughts.

12:24.800 --> 12:25.940
What?!

12:25.940 --> 12:28.940
You've already overcome makyo and 
entered a state of perfect selflessness?

12:28.940 --> 12:31.080
I knew you could do it, Yuzuki-san!

12:31.080 --> 12:33.560
Uh, y-yeah.

12:33.900 --> 12:36.120
Then you've successfully 
completed your training.

12:36.120 --> 12:37.660
We should report this to Kiki-san.

12:40.020 --> 12:43.570
<i>I can't tell them, because 
this is a personal problem</i>

12:43.950 --> 12:46.980
<i>that has nothing to do with my training.</i>

12:48.060 --> 12:52.330
<i>I can't tell them that watching them 
get along makes me feel...</i>

12:48.780 --> 12:51.130
This must be what they mean 
by perfect selflessness.

12:51.130 --> 12:52.330
You're right.

12:55.400 --> 12:56.580
<i>uneasy.</i>

12:58.290 --> 13:01.960
You did something a little 
different for your training,

13:01.960 --> 13:03.930
but it looks like it worked.

13:03.930 --> 13:04.720
Yes!

13:05.190 --> 13:07.970
I feel like I've come to understand 
my own worldly thoughts better.

13:07.970 --> 13:10.270
That's good to hear.

13:10.820 --> 13:14.290
Even if you achieve enlightenment, 
your worldly thoughts will remain,

13:14.290 --> 13:18.100
which is why you must face them 
rather than run from them.

13:18.490 --> 13:19.860
I see.

13:19.860 --> 13:25.020
If anyone says they don't have 
worldly thoughts, then...

13:25.610 --> 13:29.380
they're the biggest and quietest perv of all.

13:35.500 --> 13:39.000
I'm not dirty!

13:39.290 --> 13:43.000
<b>A virtuous man loves the mountains.</b>

13:55.900 --> 13:57.890
You've made some substantial improvements.

13:58.280 --> 14:00.020
Thank you.

14:04.020 --> 14:05.970
Let's take the afternoon off.

14:05.970 --> 14:06.440
What?

14:06.440 --> 14:07.680
But why, Kiki-san?

14:07.680 --> 14:08.600
Yeah, why?

14:08.600 --> 14:10.420
We're just getting started with our training.

14:10.420 --> 14:15.820
Calm down. Pushing yourself because you're 
in a hurry will only result in injuries.

14:15.820 --> 14:16.790
But...

14:17.130 --> 14:19.370
"Set aside fame and fortune."

14:19.370 --> 14:21.180
You know what that means, don't you, Yuzuki?

14:22.920 --> 14:35.310
<b>Set Aside Fame and Fortune</b>

14:25.260 --> 14:26.940
Set aside... what?

14:26.940 --> 14:32.290
It means stop thinking about gains and losses,

14:32.290 --> 14:35.310
and focus on the things around you.

14:35.620 --> 14:39.190
I guess it's the third rule to 
achieving enlightenment.

14:39.660 --> 14:42.810
In other words, 
resting is part of our training.

14:43.280 --> 14:46.200
I'm gonna hang out with Kagura 
since I haven't in a while.

14:47.610 --> 14:48.830
But...

14:50.420 --> 14:52.690
I can't believe we're taking today off.

14:53.630 --> 14:55.780
What's wrong, Akagami-kun?

14:56.330 --> 14:58.550
Today is December 24th.

14:59.180 --> 15:01.460
In other words, Christmas Eve.

15:01.460 --> 15:04.460
What? Akagami-kun, you don't like Christmas?

15:05.770 --> 15:12.140
Every Christmas, my father would try to 
divide his time between all his lovers.

15:12.540 --> 15:17.450
And every year, a bloodbath 
would break out at our house.

15:17.450 --> 15:19.480
Yikes.

15:19.480 --> 15:23.900
Christmas scares me. 
It's a horrifying holiday.

15:23.900 --> 15:25.480
Uh...

15:25.800 --> 15:27.430
In that case, Akagami-kun...

15:29.300 --> 15:32.490
Why don't the two of us go out together?

15:36.740 --> 15:39.980
Tomorrow, we're throwing a 
Christmas party with the others.

15:39.980 --> 15:42.500
What? Even though we live at a temple?

15:42.500 --> 15:48.130
Yeah. And we'll be exchanging presents, 
so let's choose ours together.

15:48.130 --> 15:51.500
G-G-Got... Got it!

15:51.500 --> 15:53.640
What's wrong with you, Akagami-kun?!

15:53.640 --> 15:57.640
<i>Going out together on Christmas Eve 
carries too much meaning.</i>

15:57.970 --> 16:00.020
<i>Not only that, but I'm with Yuzuki-san.</i>

16:02.020 --> 16:05.250
<i>Christmas songs and lights everywhere.</i>

16:05.250 --> 16:08.780
<i>The entire town seems to be in good spirits.</i>

16:08.780 --> 16:11.860
<i>Damn you, Christmas Eve!</i>

16:11.860 --> 16:14.780
<i>But I'll never bend to your will!</i>

16:14.780 --> 16:17.160
Let's go, Akagami-kun.

16:17.160 --> 16:18.660
Okay!

16:19.300 --> 16:20.580
This way.

16:21.630 --> 16:23.000
What do you think of this?

16:24.570 --> 16:25.840
So cute.

16:31.210 --> 16:34.180
Hooray, hooray!

16:35.500 --> 16:36.680
<i>This is too much fun!</i>

16:40.420 --> 16:42.930
<i>So this is the power of Christmas Eve.</i>

16:43.250 --> 16:45.850
<i>I require much more training.</i>

16:45.850 --> 16:47.450
Have you chosen your present yet?

16:47.450 --> 16:49.440
Huh? Er, no.

16:49.440 --> 16:52.260
I'm not sure what to buy.

16:53.050 --> 16:56.020
You don't need to think about it that hard.

16:56.020 --> 16:57.450
You think so?

16:57.450 --> 17:00.280
Buy whatever you'd want to give 
that expresses your gratitude

17:00.280 --> 17:02.700
for everything people do for you.

17:04.730 --> 17:05.720
I see.

17:05.720 --> 17:09.650
Oh, I know. There's actually 
a shop I'd recommend.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.710
Buddhist Goods Specialty Store

17:10.960 --> 17:12.710
~Tsukishita~

17:12.710 --> 17:15.720
Buddhist Goods Specialty Store

17:12.710 --> 17:15.720
~Tsukishita~

17:13.710 --> 17:15.720
A Buddhist goods store?

17:15.720 --> 17:19.220
Yeah. My senpai's family runs the shop.

17:19.220 --> 17:22.680
Since they sell stuff we use 
every day at the temple,

17:22.680 --> 17:24.340
it might be easier to find something.

17:25.780 --> 17:26.980
I see.

17:29.980 --> 17:31.620
Prayer beads...

17:31.620 --> 17:32.840
Is that what you're getting?

17:32.840 --> 17:35.830
No, I just don't have any.

17:35.830 --> 17:39.620
Oh, right. I only have informal beads.

17:39.620 --> 17:40.620
Informal?

17:40.930 --> 17:44.140
There are formal and informal prayer beads.

17:41.450 --> 17:46.000
Informal Prayer Beads

17:41.450 --> 17:46.000
Current
standard!

17:42.120 --> 17:46.000
Formal Prayer Beads

17:42.120 --> 17:46.000
108
beads!

17:44.660 --> 17:49.100
Formal beads are used for important 
occasions such as the tokudo ceremony.

17:49.100 --> 17:50.100
Ah.

17:51.830 --> 17:54.450
But they're pretty expensive.

17:55.090 --> 17:58.530
I'll have to borrow Kiki-san's or my parents' 
beads for my tokudo ceremony.

17:58.530 --> 17:59.760
I see.

18:00.130 --> 18:04.520
I'll become a proper priest soon 
and buy my own beads.

18:06.220 --> 18:09.320
Don't buy them "someday." Buy them now.

18:09.320 --> 18:10.290
Mari-san!

18:10.290 --> 18:12.020
Welcome, Yuzukin.

18:12.020 --> 18:15.210
It's good to see you again. 
This is Akagami-kun.

18:15.210 --> 18:16.300
Nice to meet you.

18:16.740 --> 18:18.540
This is my senpai, Mari-san.

18:18.540 --> 18:19.530
Hello.

18:19.800 --> 18:23.030
If you're looking for prayer beads, 
we've got some nice ones.

18:23.030 --> 18:25.860
His and her prayer beads.

18:25.860 --> 18:28.290
What? Those exist?

18:28.290 --> 18:32.090
Of course. After all, at Buddhist weddings,

18:32.090 --> 18:34.900
the couple exchanges 
prayer beads instead of rings.

18:34.900 --> 18:36.120
They do?

18:36.120 --> 18:38.550
I guess that's not common knowledge.

18:38.920 --> 18:44.290
We've got other products for couples, 
like for marriage and fertility.

18:44.290 --> 18:47.240
Why do you keep showing us those products?

18:47.240 --> 18:49.160
Because you're a couple, aren't you?

18:49.160 --> 18:49.880
A coup—

18:49.880 --> 18:52.780
No, it's not like that.

18:52.780 --> 18:53.820
You're not?

18:54.160 --> 18:56.820
But you're here together on Christmas Eve.

18:57.170 --> 18:59.200
I thought you were on a date.

19:06.950 --> 19:10.210
<i>What? Did she just realize that?!</i>

19:10.560 --> 19:13.590
Um, it really isn't like that between us.

19:14.370 --> 19:15.410
Really?

19:16.730 --> 19:17.720
There's nothing at all?

19:17.720 --> 19:19.300
N-No.

19:19.300 --> 19:22.800
But Yuzukin's blushing. 
She must feel something, right?

19:22.800 --> 19:23.600
Huh?!

19:23.600 --> 19:25.470
Don't look at me, Akagami-kun!

19:26.140 --> 19:28.730
Yuzukin went all-out today.

19:29.810 --> 19:32.350
Normally, she dresses more casually.

19:33.140 --> 19:36.110
She's even wearing makeup today.

19:37.810 --> 19:40.360
And she must be happy, 
because she's even gained some—

19:40.360 --> 19:42.360
Mari-san, I'd like this, please!

19:42.360 --> 19:44.090
Sure, thanks for shopping.

19:44.090 --> 19:46.660
It's really not like that, okay?!

19:45.370 --> 19:48.620
Join us!

19:45.370 --> 19:48.620
Prayer bead making experience!

19:45.370 --> 19:48.620
1,000 yen~

19:45.370 --> 19:48.620
Ages 5 and up

19:46.660 --> 19:47.500
Yeah, yeah.

19:47.500 --> 19:48.620
Jeez!

19:52.130 --> 19:54.750
Akagami-kun, have you chosen a present yet?

19:54.750 --> 19:57.000
Yes, thanks to you.

19:59.330 --> 20:00.880
I'm glad.

20:02.210 --> 20:07.670
<i>Was Yuzuki-san trying to cheer me up?</i>

20:10.980 --> 20:14.500
Yuzuki-san, I'm excited for tomorrow.

20:15.220 --> 20:17.210
Me, too, Akagami-kun.

20:21.130 --> 20:24.150
It's Christmas already.

20:24.150 --> 20:26.490
The year flew by.

20:26.490 --> 20:30.280
Don't you think it's been 
a little too hectic recently?

20:30.280 --> 20:36.130
So much has changed. 
I'm even steadily becoming an adult.

20:36.130 --> 20:38.660
If anything's changed, it's Mia.

20:39.250 --> 20:42.260
Is my training paying off?

20:42.260 --> 20:43.380
You've gotten sexier.

20:43.380 --> 20:44.760
What?!

20:45.120 --> 20:47.940
You seemed so fastidious at first.

20:45.340 --> 20:50.890
Show some skin?
Preposterous!

20:46.100 --> 20:48.550
Castrate him.

20:46.930 --> 20:50.890
Pay for your
 insolence with
your life!

20:48.550 --> 20:50.890
But now I hardly recognize you.

20:50.890 --> 20:53.300
Your clothes have changed.

20:53.300 --> 20:55.900
There's more emphasis on your curves.

20:55.900 --> 20:58.060
Well, it's not on purpose!

20:58.900 --> 21:00.150
Sorry, sorry.

21:00.520 --> 21:03.650
It's a good look on you, and we know 
there's no indecent reason for it.

21:03.650 --> 21:07.330
I just want Akagami to look at my boobs!

21:07.330 --> 21:08.780
That <i>is</i> an indecent reason!

21:09.450 --> 21:11.040
No, it's not.

21:11.460 --> 21:13.620
You've gotten pretty pervy, too.

21:13.620 --> 21:15.290
No, I haven't!

21:16.170 --> 21:18.790
And Yuzuki-oneechan is a quiet perv.

21:23.660 --> 21:30.040
My, my. I suppose he's changed all of us.

21:30.430 --> 21:36.440
The four of us used to plan how to drive 
Akagami-san out of the temple.

21:36.440 --> 21:38.030
You're right.

21:38.440 --> 21:42.850
The biggest change was probably 
Akagami-san's arrival.

21:43.620 --> 21:47.450
Now none of us want to get rid of him.

21:47.900 --> 21:48.730
Yeah.

21:57.250 --> 22:01.370
Akagami-san is such an interesting person.

22:05.270 --> 22:08.050
He's a real nuisance.

22:08.980 --> 22:10.870
I'll stamp him out.

23:45.020 --> 23:49.920
Question: what can be found 
dangling in the middle of the body?

23:45.020 --> 24:00.040
<b>Next Time

Seeing a Turtle Is Good Luck</b>

23:49.920 --> 23:52.410
It's sometimes thick and sometimes thin, right?

23:52.410 --> 23:53.490
Whoa, Mia!

23:53.490 --> 23:56.860
And doing it alone is a sign of adulthood.
